# Expo web is built with web.output = "single" — one index.html, client-side
# routing. Every deep link must therefore be served index.html with a 200 (not
# a redirect), or a refresh on /settings returns a Cloudflare 404.
#
# Required for "single". NOT required for "static" output, which emits real
# per-route HTML — that asymmetry is the easy thing to get wrong here.
/*    /index.html   200
